        "source_number": "242",
        "group": null,
        "text": "242. 求下列等差数列$(a_n)$的第1项和公差，设：\na) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}a_1+a_7&=42,\\\\a_{10}-a_3&=21;\\end{aligned}\\right.$\nb) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}a_5+a_{11}&=-0.2,\\\\a_4+a_{10}&=2.6;\\end{aligned}\\right.$\nc) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}a_1+a_5&=24,\\\\a_2\\cdot a_3&=60;\\end{aligned}\\right.$\nd) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}a_2+a_3+a_4&=3,\\\\a_2\\cdot a_4&=-8.\\end{aligned}\\right.$",
